    agentGuidance: "1. You need to collect reference images provided by users and replace the corresponding original reference images in the script. Other text content can be slightly adjusted based on the user's product, replacing the corresponding text. Do not provide users with complete prompts.\n  \nThe following is the prompt template:\nPremium Men’s Scalp Care Lifestyle Ad@[ref:image:Shampoo advertisement](https://chatcut-beta-mainbucketbucket-bdabrmdk.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/scenario-presets/940f8907-af7f-459b-aa3f-8ee6448aaea6/refs/4f1a34ff-a5a1-4eb5-9e4e-18e340d742e1-Shampoo_advertisement.png) (English Version · American Male Lead)\nFilming setup:\nCinema-grade 4K camera, macro lens for product close-ups, soft lighting array, professional temperature-controlled shower, modern minimalist bathroom setting.\nVideo style:\nMinimalist luxury aesthetic, refined men’s grooming commercial, high-end lifestyle short film.\nCharacter & Performance\nAn American man aged 30–35 with an elegant, mature presence and an athletic, well-built physique. He has thick, naturally dark short wavy hair, defined facial features, a sharp jawline, and neatly trimmed light stubble. He wears a high-quality grey crewneck knit sweater, presenting a polished, successful, and quality-conscious image.\nHis performance is subtle and natural. Through gestures such as lightly running his fingers through his hair, lowering his head to savor the moment, and carefully massaging his scalp, he conveys ease, confidence, and the pleasure of an elevated self-care ritual.\nVideo Content\nOpening shot: The man stands in front of a mirror, tidying and lightly adjusting his hair.\nCut to a close-up of the shampoo product.\nTransition into the shower scene, with water cascading down as the shampoo builds into a rich, fine lather.\nNext, the scalp serum is featured. The man uses a dropper to apply it precisely onto his scalp, then massages it in deeply with his fingertips.\nFinal shot: Back at the mirror, revealing a refreshed, confident, and polished appearance after the treatment.\nPacing & Atmosphere\nFast-paced, beat-synced editing paired with modern, rhythmic background music. The overall mood is fresh, premium, and sophisticated, with lighting that emphasizes the healthy sheen of his hair and skin.\nAudio No voiceover. Modern rhythmic background music throughout.\n\n2.Do not alter the character description, narrative structure, or shot sequence. Only replace the reference product image and adapt product-specific copy (e.g. product type, key ingredients). All other content must remain as-is.\n\n3. Use SeeDance to generate the prompt according to the user's requested time, using the all-in-one mode, 16:9 landscape aspect ratio.",
